<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6266" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβο-άω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					465
				</span></i>
			, 
				Dor.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					639
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεβόησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.53
				</span></i>
			, 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέβωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			, al., part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμβώσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				3.38
			</span></i>:—<i>cry, shout aloud,</i> esp. in sign of grief
			or astonishment, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμβώσας μέγα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
				</span></i>
			 ll.cc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1079
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκτρὸν ἀνεβόασεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hel.</u>
					184
				</span></i>
			; of the <i>war-cry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.1.38
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. "παρεῖναι τοὺς
			πρώτους</span>" <i>call out</i> 'let the front rank pass',
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				4.2.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάδ᾽ ἀναβοάσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					525
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχη ἀ.</span>”
				<i>bewail, lament,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					572
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πανὸς ἀναβοᾷ γάμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					190
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. acc. pers.,
				<i>call on,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμμάχους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1592
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀσκληπιόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					639
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>cry up, extol,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				98.12
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
